Provides: gimlet
Description: local workbench for system, crypto, and metadata tasks
 One tool registry, one report format, one configuration file, one audit trail,
 and one command line for system administration, file encryption and signing,
 and metadata removal.
 .
 Everything runs locally: no network calls, no telemetry, no auto-update. There
 is no daemon and no listening port.

